rmone Range Products, a specialty therapeutics brand focused on longevity, hormone health, recovery science, and human performance solutions. Fredun Pharmaceuticals Limited was incorporated in 1987 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","employees":736,"earnDates":[],"exDiv":1782172800,"asOf":1795529339},"analyst":null,"cap":"Other","caFix":null,"fetched":1795529338,"source":"Yahoo Finance (public chart, fundamentals-timeseries & quoteSummary endpoints)","news":{"q":"\"Fredun Pharmaceuticals\" when:90d","items":[{"t":"Fredun Pharma net profit doubles to ₹18.6 crore in Q2FY27","s":"scanx.trade","d":1795295477,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitwFBVV95cUxPUkpPRFJZQUVTQ0xFNzFFSktmOUNuN29RNzdDMjFjX01Wa1NBQ2hoejFSd3JZNDhBZWx1TmhHU0FFbW5aWkZsZm1vUEhTS3h0VFJsQVZpb3JOU25INlhIRzhfeEpfR3FYcE4xRDJjSjBMb0JQMVJnLXFkTFg3OTV4aFNBT3pQTnF5U3JoMzZDQm1xU2puam1rTm44N3FMZGZ5TmRMc3NsY1RSWkt0S2VHVGJLcjRlWGc?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Fredun Pharmaceuticals Limited (FREDUN.BO) Stock Price, News, Quote & History","s":"Yahoo! Finance Canada","d":1795168744,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTE40ZXhZQ3VwbmR1bUZVTEtXUHdXMzNxZkEtd2lTYWhFNjJYaWc2Y1FOYWJ4Uk9COXdHVmJ5Q182SkhCdEk5LWdLRWI5OWtMYlhUWVBpbjhrNy0?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Fredun Pharmaceuticals Ltd. (FREDUN) 52 Week High Streak: Second Straight Session","s":"Univest","d":1795146960,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPd2dMWnhibERjV0FnNlZRY2NjRXZMeGhHQnN3S1RHS09DUmJUR0V1X0duVzBGZjFJdlpjbTZYX1ZISTZvWUxHOHd6VkctZHVFdzE4TG5JYWJfZlhVMVpLVERmUUNsUllBenN1TTNaMW5pV1VlMGhFelFydXMwU1p4WVlsRmxzN2VrYlBzanJsOWZWcy1ySkE?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Fredun Pharmaceuticals Share Price Near Peak; Valuation","s":"Univest","d":1795146960,"u":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxNdms5Ukp5TGpLWTdRTnJpVFdxeHBocnlPZEFfUFRLS1RKT1ZHZGNMVEhMaW5BM0tEN29Bel9OZXpQdzR6VERzemlRLWRhLUVNcVdhbXF3THBibUk0SkF6dHZxeXdlX3VFX1pNZ2Q5dFNuLXE5YmttQXZkLUJzNlE5RUlXbzNwUVpoVk4tYWZEeERwR21lb0t3MGswdkRWZw?oc=5","g":[]},{"t":"Fredun Pharm